OL,3,GNEWSABury FC fans say bumper FA Cup
OL,4,Acrowd 'meant everything'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFans have told of their delight as Bury
OL,7,FFC experienced its biggest crowd since
OL,8,Fthe resurgent football club was
OL,9,Freformed three years ago.
OL,11,FKatie Maken, 18, who joined excited
OL,12,Fsupporters at the Staff of Life pub
OL,13,Fahead of the crunch FA Cup qualifier
OL,14,Fagainst Harrogate Town earlier, said:
OL,15,F"This means everything to the club -
OL,16,Fthe fans coming back who we've not seen
OL,17,Ffor years."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
