OL,3,GNEWSABury FC fans say bumper FA Cup
OL,4,Acrowd 'meant everything'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Shakers were expelled from the
OL,7,FEnglish Football League in 2019
OL,8,Ffollowing financial struggles, before
OL,9,Fthe club was eventually reformed in its
OL,10,Fcurrent format in 2023.
OL,12,FAnd the loyal hordes of supporters were
OL,13,Frewarded for their efforts as Bury
OL,14,Fsecured a replay after a hard-fought
OL,15,F1-1 draw at Gigg Lane.
